      "expect": {
        "exit": 0,
        "stdout": "after\n",
        "stderr": "1: Bad file descriptor\nrc=1\ne=1\n"
      },
      "note": "bash 5.2: a descriptor `exec` closed for the shell refuses a later dup from it before the command runs. In a subshell so the battery's shared session keeps its streams."
